  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 7.2.4:\n\n## Fixed\n- Texts of some annotations are changed after calling the OptimizeFonts() method. (DOC-6592)\n- Redact opacity is ignored when saving a PDF with redact annotations as images. (DOC-6569)\n- MergeWithDocument() method throws exception for a specific PDF. (DOC-6600)\n- FormXObject constructor throws ArgumentNullException for a specific PDF. (DOC-6601)",
